# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Game dumps, BIOS images and saves must never be committed.
#
# The emulator itself is fine to publish. Game ROMs and console BIOS files are
# copyrighted, and public repositories hosting them get takedown notices — and
# sometimes lose the whole account. Git also keeps deleted files in history, so
# a file committed once is still there after you delete it. Keep this file in
# place from the very first commit.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

